<h1>fftwall</h1>
% template `{get_lib_file art.tpl}
<p>I got bored of my wallpaper, so I made some scripts to procedurally generate Fourier transform wallpapers for fun. They are cool.</p>
<p>I was inspired by <a href="https://wallhaven.cc/user/PureMathArt">PureMathArt</a>’s Fourier transform series on Wallhaven. Reverse-engineering <a href="https://wallhaven.cc/w/jeyg2w">one of their spectra</a> (a coupled-oscillator lattice) is what led to this tool.</p>
